From 7a0cb7bb57e805700a8e3048822d7ad0397ce107 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arnold Nyamongo <arnoldnyams@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 10:46:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Spread the Glow Arcade across every Start.ng page

The whimsy now lives on the whole site, still on the original cream, ink
and lime theme.

- .whimsy-site wraps the chrome in the (site) layout; SiteSky adds soft
  orbs and fireflies behind every page except the home/sign-in skies
- page titles and section headings use Baloo, with a lime star after each
  page title; body copy, docs prose, footer headings and card titles keep
  the house font
- every .btn / .ghost / nav CTA / Google button is a chunky 3-D arcade
  button with a lime glow and sparkle on hover
- glass filter bars, docs sidebar, profile header, panels, boards, email
  and submit cards, modals, auth card, help panel and toasts
- lime active chips/tabs/segments/pagination, lime focus rings, lime
  underlines in nav and footer, card sparkles and glow on hover
- tournament panel gets the pulsing conic border; leaderboard rows and
  creator art respond to the pointer
- WhimsyLayer now mounts once in the site layout, re-scans cards after
  navigation, and auto-tilts game, category, promo, board, profile and
  panel cards; fixed a debounce bug where the cursor trail prevented the
  scan from ever attaching
- full light/dark support; immersive play/hangout and Sun Market untouched

Audited all site pages at 1440 and 390 (zero horizontal overflow), tilt on
games/tournament/leaderboard, glass and heading styles, and the live build.
