diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 0a88d38..d47cd4f 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -10,6 +10,12 @@ A working recreation of [start.ng](https://start.ng), Nigeria's home for browser
 - **Docs rendered from the original:** https://startng-three.vercel.app/docs
 - **Plain-text docs for AI:** https://startng-three.vercel.app/docs.md
 
+## The Glow Arcade
+
+The whole start.ng site now carries a playful **Glow Arcade** layer on top of the original cream, ink and lime theme. Every page — games, categories, game detail, tournament, leaderboard, creators, docs, about, profile and sign-in — shares it: soft lime-and-cream washes with drifting orbs and firefly specks, bubbly Baloo page titles with a lime star, chunky dark 3-D buttons and cream ghost buttons, glass filter bars, sidebars and panels, lime active chips, card glow/sparkles on hover, and pointer tilt. The header, footer, auth modal, help panel and toasts join in, and it all works in dark mode. The home hero keeps its glowing lime-and-gold ribbon.
+
+The immersive game-play and Hangout routes are deliberately left as full-screen experiences, and The Sun Market keeps its own design. The layer is scoped under `.whimsy` (`.whimsy-site` wraps the site chrome in `app/(site)/layout.tsx`), with behaviour in `components/WhimsyLayer.tsx` (cursor, trail, tilt) and `components/WhimsyOrbs.tsx` / `components/SiteSky.tsx` (orbs and stars). Baloo 2 is loaded with `next/font/local`.
+
 ## What is included
 
 - The full 189-game catalogue, 33 categories and 39 independent creators.
